The name is so freaking cool but honestly the concept is quite basic and has been done many times. Pocket dimensions/closed dimensions are nothing new, you should find a twist to make it more unique and interesting.

Because of the name I thought it was a road that ended in an actual reality vacuum, something akin to the Red Dimension, or maybe a more spiritual/religious thing such as Heaven or Limbo.

I hope you find what will make it a more fleshed out concept :)







